@model Ticket
@{ViewData["Title"]="Document claim stub";}
<section class="content-shell narrow ops-claim"><div class="panel"><img class="ticket-logo" src="/sims/brand-logo.php" alt="ICAS Philippines"/><p class="eyebrow">REGISTRAR · DOCUMENT CLAIM STUB</p><h1>@Model.ClaimCode</h1><p><strong>@Model.RequestType</strong></p><dl><dt>Request</dt><dd>@Model.TicketNumber</dd><dt>Requested by</dt><dd>@Model.CustomerName</dd><dt>Student / reference</dt><dd>@Model.StudentNumber</dd><dt>Document status</dt><dd>@Model.DocumentStatus</dd></dl><p>Present this stub and the identity documents required by the Registrar. Staff must verify the recipient before handing over the document.</p><p class="muted">This stub is not an academic document, payment receipt, or authorization for someone else to collect it. The code alone does not prove identity.</p></div><div class="actions no-print"><button class="btn" type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print claim stub</button><a class="btn btn-soft" asp-action="Request" asp-route-id="@Model.TicketNumber">Back to request</a></div></section>
